<http://data.silknow.org/object/cf41cf3a-8f08-3d16-bd29-f9398bc587ad/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Shawl, gold tissue (probably silk warp and gold weft), brocaded with silver-wrapped thread in flower heads. Embroidered with red and green silk, gold-wrapped thread, flattened gold wire and metal spangles with floral buta in the corners of the field, a deep border of floral buta at the ends and floral bands in the borders. The edges are hemmed with embossed silver ribbon; silver tinsel fringes. Lined with red muslin."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/cf41cf3a-8f08-3d16-bd29-f9398bc587ad> .

